::node [id=stop type=assertion confidence=1.00 scope=all updated=2026-11-25]
::dense
return|holdout-read|P2
::end
::assertion
trigger: verdicts >= charter.max_tested OR Steward stop
check: one holdout comparison by the Critic if the base changed; last event kind = return with P2 and selection; R1-R15
on-pass: halt
on-fail: ->[:requires] contract
::end
